  "description": "Twenty measures grouped 8 + 8 + 4. The identifying C-Ab minor sixth expands to Eb-C major sixth and D-Bb minor sixth; two-bar harmonic breaths oppose sustained high notes to low half-note machinery. This is neither the Counterworks duple interlock nor a transposed generic minor loop. Bars 1 and 17 Ab is a prolonged flat-sixth appoggiatura resolving to G over Cm; bar 2 F resolves Eb. Bar 15 explicitly intensifies with G7 flat nine, released in bar 16. 45.283 seconds.",
